0e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.2 counterexample preceding Theorem 1.2.1; Figure 1.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"14"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>35</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书相关反例现象已核对；本地具体化对象通过有限关系枚举独立验证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>工作于ZFC；局部合流、合流、正规形、可汇合与闭包见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"766a1d5bf25248d1\" href=\"?note=766a1d5bf25248d1\" title=\"56-df-locally-confluent\">56-df-locally-confluent</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c74959a8cb14eaa5\" href=\"?note=c74959a8cb14eaa5\" title=\"56-df-confluent\">56-df-confluent</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e295b2b3159f2b40\" href=\"?note=e295b2b3159f2b40\" title=\"56-df-normal-form\">56-df-normal-form</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1de67f45113d6dcf\" href=\"?note=1de67f45113d6dcf\" title=\"56-df-joinable\">56-df-joinable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"9ddd157960e9574a\" href=\"?note=9ddd157960e9574a\" title=\"56-df-relation-closure\">56-df-relation-closure</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A:=\\{0,1,2,3\\},\\qquad P:=\\{(1,0),(1,2),(2,1),(2,3)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A:=\\{0,1,2,3\\},\\qquad P:=\\{(1,0),(1,2),(2,1),(2,3)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocallyConfluent}(A,P)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Confluent}(A,P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LocallyConfluent}(A,P)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Confluent}(A,P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NF}(A,P,0)\\land\\mathrm{NF}(A,P,3)\\land\n(1,0)\\in P^*\\land(1,3)\\in P^*\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Join}(A,P,0,3).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NF}(A,P,0)\\land\\mathrm{NF}(A,P,3)\\land\n(1,0)\\in P^*\\land(1,3)\\in P^*\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Join}(A,P,0,3).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地四点具体化用于展示原书p14讨论的现象；OCR图形箭头未单独作图像核验，因而不声称这是对原图对象的逐字转写。有限关系已独立枚举验证：1处两分支0、2在0汇合（2→1→0），2处两分支1、3在3汇合（1→2→3）；但共同起点1可达的两个不同正规形0、3不能汇合。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-locally-confluent","status":"resolved","id":"766a1d5bf25248d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-locally-confluent]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-confluent","status":"resolved","id":"c74959a8cb14eaa5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-confluent]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"e295b2b3159f2b40","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-joinable","status":"resolved","id":"1de67f45113d6dcf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-joinable]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-relation-closure","status":"resolved","id":"9ddd157960e9574a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-relation-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-locally-confluent","status":"resolved","id":"766a1d5bf25248d1","anchor":"ref-6